<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela Banco Latino sell-off to begin with unit.</title>
<headline>Venezuela Banco Latino sell-off to begin with unit.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuelan insurance company Latino de Seguros, part of the Latino financial group whose collapse marked the start of the country's 1994-5 financial crisis, will be auctioned on November 25, Grupo Latino said.</p>
<p>The company will be sold for a base price of 1.7 billion bolivars ($3.6 million).</p>
<p>The sale of the rest of the group, which includes Banco Latino, Latino Investment Consortium, Arfinan Leasing Co and Latimer Investments, will follow before the end of the year, Latino said.</p>
<p>-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600</p>
</text>
